nob, not a gate.","The mcp blue-green readiness gate is at autodeploy.sh:782: 'curl -fsS -m 3 \"http://127.0.0.1:${mcp_newport}/health\" >/dev/null 2>&1 && { mcp_ok=1; break; }' inside the block that errs 'mcp-unhealthy' at :786."],"finding":"The Evidence citation `infra/scripts/autodeploy.sh:130` for 'the blue-green readiness gate promotes on that same probe' points at unrelated code: line 130 is a disk-pressure-prune config comment (PRESSURE_PRUNE_MIN_INTERVAL). The actual mcp blue-green /health readiness gate is at autodeploy.sh:782 (curl -fsS -m 3 .../health >/dev/null 2>&1; err mcp-unhealthy). The underlying assertion is true and verified, but the line number misdirects a reader verifying it.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f768e780937a784f5","impact":0.85,"is_primary":null,"location":"Evidence — `infra/scripts/autodeploy.sh:130`","norm_id":"n008a657e104c436e","priority":0.85,"reason":"veto:cited-reference-inaccurate","recalled":false,"scenarios":["A reviewer or implementer follows the :130 citation to confirm the gate and lands on disk-pressure config, then must hunt for the real gate."],"severity":"critical","suggested_fix":"Replace 'infra/scripts/autodeploy.sh:130' with 'infra/scripts/autodeploy.sh:782 (mcp blue-green /health gate; mcp-unhealthy at :786)'.","tier":"LLM","validity":1.0,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"no","claims_absence":"na","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"no","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"yes","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"yes","path_reachable":"na","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"contradicts_reality",